  clock: 4  # d181
  nonce: d181  # d181
  message: "DONE — STALE on both halves; no code or doc change needed. Verified rather than assumed.\n\nFiled: 'spec 1530 green-done presence test + 799 always-reflect prose are false for evidence_lang/evidence_spans (0% populated)'.\n\nevidence_lang: measured 138626/138626 edges populated — 100%, not 0%. ADR-0040 central-stamped it at Edge.create (PR f59a286b, 2026-07-11), which POST-DATES this filing. So the spec's green presence test at line 1699 (execution_id, run_signature, evidence_lang) is now TRUE, which is exactly what the item asked for.\n\nevidence_spans: measured 0/138626, correctly — but ADR-0040 REMOVED the field, and the spec already says so at line 890: 'The meta.evidence[] multi-pass accumulator and meta.evidence_spans were descoped per ADR-0040 — never populated by any producer.' So the spec does not make a false promise about it; it discloses the descope.\n\nBoth halves therefore resolve without action. Minor residual noted, deliberately NOT folded in: line 902 still describes evidence_lang as 'optional ... Defaults to src node's language if omitted', which reads oddly now that it is always stamped — though it remains correct as consumer-side guidance for older maps, so changing it is a judgement call rather than a correction."  # d181
